    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Initiation 1 — The Bargain.</strong> The Pact slot comes online (existing class resource — see your Doctrine for the generation / tier rule). While a creature, object, or place is bargained-with as your Pact subject, you may sustain one additional manifestation on or near them at no extra upkeep against your Clarity.</p>\n<p style=\"opacity:0.7;font-size:0.85em\">Discipline (passive): Concurrency +1 (informational; surfaced on upkeep cards). Skill rank +1 in two of: Diplomacy, Insight, Intimidation, Lore.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"pkInit1\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>The Bargain</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> Passive (per pact) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> — &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">While a creature/object/place is your bargained Pact subject, you may sustain one additional manifestation on or near them at no extra upkeep against your Clarity.</div>\n</div>",
